Benchmark figures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The real-world quarter-mile, trap-speed and top-speed figures that MotoQuant
validates against are cited facts taken from the published sources named
alongside each record: magazine road tests, instrumented GPS/timing-system
tests, timeslips and published aggregators. They remain attributable to
those sources. MotoQuant claims no ownership of them, and each record keeps
its source label so it can be checked.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Catalog data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bike, tire and parts specifications in the catalog (motoquant.db and
motoquant/scraper/known_bikes*.py) were compiled from publicly available
manufacturer data: published specifications, owner's and service manuals,
and press kits. Retail part prices were compiled from public retailer
listings. Values that were estimated or derived, not published, are marked
as such in the source files. Manufacturers may revise their figures;
corrections are welcome via GitHub issues.
